1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,779
If your heart feels heavy right now, let me ask you just one thing.

2
00:00:05,330 --> 00:00:06,554
Are you sadness?

3
00:00:06,754 --> 00:00:09,058
Or are you someone who is feeling sadness?

4
00:00:09,608 --> 00:00:14,540
It sounds like a small question, but this one question can change your life.

5
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:19,204
Today, let's talk about feelings, thoughts, and who you really are.

6
00:00:19,754 --> 00:00:22,058
And stay with me until the end.

7
00:00:22,258 --> 00:00:26,650
Because the people who rose the highest all knew how to do one thing.

8
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:29,060
We are souls.

9
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:34,300
We came to this Earth wearing a body, to experience countless feelings.

10
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:38,388
Joy, sadness, anger, and fear.

11
00:00:38,938 --> 00:00:44,338
So whatever you feel, and however long you've been carrying it, it's something you're experiencing.

12
00:00:44,538 --> 00:00:46,194
You are not that feeling.

13
00:00:46,744 --> 00:00:47,932
Think of the sky.

14
00:00:48,132 --> 00:00:53,064
No matter how dark the storm clouds get, the sky has never once been stained.

15
00:00:53,264 --> 00:00:56,684
The clouds pass, and the sky stays the same.

16
00:00:57,234 --> 00:00:59,898
Feelings are the clouds.

17
00:01:00,098 --> 00:01:01,322
You are the sky.

18
00:01:02,472 --> 00:01:06,288
But before you can watch the clouds, there's something you need to do first.

19
00:01:06,488 --> 00:01:07,460
Accept them.

20
00:01:08,010 --> 00:01:11,142
When a feeling rises, we usually push it away.

21
00:01:11,342 --> 00:01:12,818
I shouldn't feel this.

22
00:01:13,018 --> 00:01:14,422
This feeling is bad.

23
00:01:14,622 --> 00:01:18,978
But the harder you push, the tighter that feeling holds on.

24
00:01:19,528 --> 00:01:22,552
Darkness is just as precious as light.

25
00:01:22,752 --> 00:01:27,684
Sadness, anger, and fear are just as precious as joy.

26
00:01:27,884 --> 00:01:29,864
Every feeling is energy.

27
00:01:30,064 --> 00:01:33,556
It's part of the universe, and part of you.

28
00:01:34,106 --> 00:01:39,938
In this material world, we learned that only the bright, positive things are good.

29
00:01:40,138 --> 00:01:41,470
But that's only half.

30
00:01:41,670 --> 00:01:45,810
That half isn't all of you, and it isn't all of the universe.

31
00:01:46,010 --> 00:01:50,006
You are everything that is, holding both the light and the dark.

32
00:01:50,556 --> 00:01:53,292
So accepting isn't hard.

33
00:01:53,492 --> 00:01:58,496
You just say to whatever thought or feeling comes up: Oh, I'm feeling this.

34
00:01:58,696 --> 00:01:59,920
I want this.

35
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,452
I don't like this.

36
00:02:01,652 --> 00:02:03,524
Right now, I'm sad.

37
00:02:04,074 --> 00:02:09,618
As you accept them one by one, you're accepting yourself, and accepting the universe.

38
00:02:09,818 --> 00:02:14,354
And before you know it, you come to love yourself, and the universe.

39
00:02:14,904 --> 00:02:19,440
Then even when something truly hard comes into your life, it's different.

40
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:20,936
It still hurts.

41
00:02:21,136 --> 00:02:22,576
It's still painful.

42
00:02:22,776 --> 00:02:25,728
You might shout, cry, even curse.

43
00:02:25,928 --> 00:02:31,616
But even then, the love and peace deep inside you never disappear, not for a single moment.

44
00:02:32,166 --> 00:02:36,162
That's why, even in a painful moment, you can be grateful.

45
00:02:36,362 --> 00:02:40,178
Because that, too, is an equally precious experience.

46
00:02:41,328 --> 00:02:44,424
So how can you feel this deeply without drowning in it?

47
00:02:44,624 --> 00:02:45,704
Think of an actor.

48
00:02:46,254 --> 00:02:48,810
A good actor really cries in a sad scene.

49
00:02:49,010 --> 00:02:51,566
They feel that sadness with their whole body.

50
00:02:51,766 --> 00:02:56,769
But when the director calls cut, they wipe their tears and come back to themselves.

51
00:02:56,970 --> 00:02:59,526
The actor experienced the role.

52
00:02:59,726 --> 00:03:01,382
They didn't become it.

53
00:03:01,932 --> 00:03:06,359
We're on the stage of this Earth too, playing countless emotional scenes.

54
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:11,312
Feel them deeply, but remember that the role isn't you.

55
00:03:11,862 --> 00:03:13,914
Here's how it works in daily life.

56
00:03:14,114 --> 00:03:18,578
When we're angry, we usually say, I'm angry.

57
00:03:18,778 --> 00:03:23,314
In that moment, it feels like you and the anger are one.

58
00:03:23,864 --> 00:03:31,388
Right then, take just one step back and notice: oh, anger is passing through me right now.

59
00:03:31,588 --> 00:03:33,460
That moment is the cut.

60
00:03:33,660 --> 00:03:35,172
You've already separated.

61
00:03:35,722 --> 00:03:38,278
You can create that distance anytime.

62
00:03:38,478 --> 00:03:39,774
Even right now.

63
00:03:39,974 --> 00:03:45,662
And because you know you can always come back, you can feel even more deeply, without fear.

64
00:03:46,812 --> 00:03:48,036
Thoughts are the same.

65
00:03:48,586 --> 00:03:53,014
You are someone who thinks, someone who has thoughts.

66
00:03:53,214 --> 00:03:55,770
But you are not those thoughts.

67
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:57,507
I'm not enough.

68
00:03:57,708 --> 00:03:59,148
It'll never work for me.

69
00:03:59,347 --> 00:04:02,983
Thoughts like these pass by countless times a day.

70
00:04:03,184 --> 00:04:05,956
But they're just boats drifting down a river.

71
00:04:06,156 --> 00:04:08,244
They are not who you are.

72
00:04:08,794 --> 00:04:13,294
The Indian sage Ramana Maharshi taught one question his whole life.

73
00:04:13,494 --> 00:04:14,358
Who am I?

74
00:04:14,908 --> 00:04:20,848
If I'm not this body, not these thoughts, and not these feelings, then who am I?

75
00:04:21,998 --> 00:04:24,878
The real you is the one watching all of it.

76
00:04:25,078 --> 00:04:30,657
The awareness that quietly notices feelings coming and going, and thoughts coming and going.

77
00:04:31,207 --> 00:04:33,404
That awareness is light.

78
00:04:33,604 --> 00:04:36,159
And that light is connected to the whole universe.

79
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:41,112
Feelings and thoughts are only shadows passing briefly over that light.

80
00:04:42,262 --> 00:04:47,770
And remarkably, the people who rose the highest knew how to do exactly this.

81
00:04:47,970 --> 00:04:52,974
To step back and watch their feelings and thoughts as separate from themselves.

82
00:04:53,524 --> 00:05:00,616
The Roman emperor Marcus Aurelius, even on military campaigns, wrote notes meant only for himself.

83
00:05:00,816 --> 00:05:05,748
It was a practice of stepping back and watching his own anger.

84
00:05:05,948 --> 00:05:09,944
Those notes are the Meditations, still read today.

85
00:05:10,494 --> 00:05:21,690
Basketball coach Phil Jackson taught meditation to Michael Jordan and his players, so that even in the heat of the game, they could stay present without being swept away by emotion.

86
00:05:21,890 --> 00:05:25,454
And that team won championship after championship.

87
00:05:26,004 --> 00:05:32,088
Investor Ray Dalio says to have a higher-level you, one that looks down on yourself from above.

88
00:05:32,638 --> 00:05:38,398
And Viktor Frankl, the psychiatrist who lost everything in the Nazi camps, left us this.

89
00:05:38,598 --> 00:05:43,818
Everything can be taken from a person but one thing: the freedom to choose your attitude.

90
00:05:44,368 --> 00:05:48,364
People swept up in their feelings and thoughts get dragged around by them.

91
00:05:48,564 --> 00:05:53,568
But people who can separate from them can stand above them, and choose their next move.

92
00:05:53,768 --> 00:05:56,576
That's what higher consciousness really means.

93
00:05:57,726 --> 00:06:01,362
So starting today, try just three things.

94
00:06:01,912 --> 00:06:09,580
One, when a feeling rises, instead of saying I'm angry, say: I'm experiencing anger right now.

95
00:06:10,130 --> 00:06:15,062
Two, when a heavy thought comes, say once: this is a thought I have.

96
00:06:15,262 --> 00:06:16,342
It's not me.

97
00:06:16,892 --> 00:06:21,536
Three, once a day, quietly ask: Who am I?

98
00:06:22,686 --> 00:06:25,098
So let's try it together, right now.

99
00:06:25,648 --> 00:06:28,204
Sit comfortably and close your eyes.

100
00:06:31,754 --> 00:06:33,410
Breathe in slowly…

101
00:06:37,610 --> 00:06:39,806
and breathe out, long.

102
00:06:45,356 --> 00:06:46,292
Once more.

103
00:06:46,492 --> 00:06:48,148
Breathe in slowly…

104
00:06:52,348 --> 00:06:54,544
and breathe out, long.

105
00:07:00,094 --> 00:07:02,866
Think of one feeling you've been having a lot lately.

106
00:07:08,416 --> 00:07:10,180
Don't push it away.

107
00:07:10,380 --> 00:07:12,396
First, just accept it.

108
00:07:12,596 --> 00:07:13,820
This is energy too.

109
00:07:14,020 --> 00:07:15,604
This is part of me too.

110
00:07:22,154 --> 00:07:25,106
Now, feel the one who is feeling it.

111
00:07:31,656 --> 00:07:35,004
And silently, say to yourself: Cut.

112
00:07:38,554 --> 00:07:43,162
Slowly take that feeling off like a coat, and set it down beside you.

113
00:07:51,712 --> 00:07:54,520
If a thought comes up, watch it like a cloud.

114
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,196
And let it drift by.

115
00:08:04,746 --> 00:08:10,398
Now, with the feeling and the thought set down, feel the quiet you that remains.

116
00:08:20,948 --> 00:08:22,388
That is the real you.

117
00:08:26,938 --> 00:08:29,350
Now, take a deep breath in…

118
00:08:33,550 --> 00:08:37,186
and as you slowly breathe out, open your eyes.

119
00:08:41,336 --> 00:08:43,424
At the beginning, I asked you.

120
00:08:43,624 --> 00:08:47,116
Are you sadness, or someone feeling sadness?

121
00:08:47,666 --> 00:08:49,106
Now you know the answer.

122
00:08:49,306 --> 00:08:50,890
You are not that one feeling.

123
00:08:51,090 --> 00:08:53,394
You are not that one thought.

124
00:08:53,594 --> 00:08:57,662
You are the sky, holding and experiencing all of it.

125
00:08:58,212 --> 00:09:02,208
Whatever you feel, whatever you think, accept it first.

126
00:09:02,408 --> 00:09:16,952
The feelings that seem positive, and the feelings that seem negative, from the view of the whole universe, high, wide, and deep, everything that is, they are equally beautiful and precious experiences.

127
00:09:17,502 --> 00:09:18,726
Feel deeply.

128
00:09:18,926 --> 00:09:23,642
And whenever you need to, call cut, and come back to the sky.

129
00:09:24,192 --> 00:09:28,728
In the comments, write the feeling you want to call cut on today.

130
00:09:29,278 --> 00:09:30,466
Play your own game.
